      326.16,
      562.02,
      462.23
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/ servitude onwhich is to be acquired are hereby required to appearpersonally, or by agents duly authorised in writing, beforeme at the Divisional Secretariat, Udadumbara, on the 17thMay 2017 at 10.00 a.m and hereby requested to notify to mein writing (in duplicate) on or before the 10th May 2017 natureof their interests in the land, the particulars of their claimsfor compensation for the acquisition of the said land, theamount of compensation and the details of the computationof such amount.",
